  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#defectDescription">
    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/defectDescription"/>
    <rdfs:label>defect description</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Lowercase-normalised, whitespace-collapsed copy of the repeated &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/quality#failureNote&gt;. Normalisation lives in the Celery task and is the join key — keep it stable. Also reused by &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/handover#DLPDefect&gt; (N8).</rdfs:comment>
    <dcterms:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#elementCount">
    <rdfs:label>element count</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated"/>
    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/elementCount"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Number of &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/building#Element&gt; triples extracted from a model upload. Polymorphic — domain unspecified (antipattern #8).</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#modelRevision">
    <dcterms:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/modelRevision"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Project-unique identifier of the IFC upload that produced this element. Plain string — typically a short id minted server-side. Lets a later revision supersede prior elements without losing the audit chain (PROV-O carries the activity). Polymorphic — carried on &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/building#Element&gt; and &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/building#IfcModel&gt;.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>model revision</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
